<title>POLAND: Polish 1996 rapeseed output down to 438,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Polish 1996 rapeseed output down to 438,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish rapeseed output fell to 438,000 tonnes in 1996 from 1.377 million tonnes last year, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said on Friday.</p>
<p>On August 2, GUS said it expected rapeseed output this year to fall to between 440,000 and 470,000 tonnes.  </p>
<p> PRELIMINARY RAPESEED PRODUCTION RESULTS    1996	1995</p>
<p>  Output (in million tonnes)		   0.438	1.377</p>
<p>  Yields (in quintals/hectare)		15.90	22.70</p>
<p>  Surface area (in hectares)		  275,000    606,000</p>
<p>NOTE: GUS plans to publish its final 1996 production figures in late November or early December.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
